// using https://www.shadertoy.com/view/X3ccDX basic raytracing setup

// A simple raytraced tree implemented by unrolling recursion.
// Long compile-time and only few levels possible but runs fast.
// Uses bounding volumes for efficient rendering of branches.

// tags: 3d, ray, cast, trace, tree, rec, unroll, plant, vegetation

